<title>JAPAN: Sumikin Bussan to be listed on OSE on December 17.</title>
<headline>Sumikin Bussan to be listed on OSE on December 17.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sumikin Bussan Corp, currently registered on the over-the-counter market, are to be listed on the first section of the Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) on December 17, the OSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Japanese trading house mainly engages in trading of steel products.</p>
</text>
